	quest.60CF367C4D000FCE.quest_subtitle: "We've been awaiting you."
	quest.60FF7EB2E027DC0E.quest_desc: [
		"Stone, Cobblestone, Smooth Stone, whatever."
		""
		"You get the point. A common material always readily available to you. Get some of it for now. Upgrade those tools of yours. I suggest a paxel or a AIOT for less clutter in your inventory."
	]
	quest.60FF7EB2E027DC0E.quest_subtitle: "\"Sometimes we must be like stone, strong enough on our own.\""
	quest.60FF7EB2E027DC0E.title: "Cobble Cobble"
	quest.627F17A329AD2A10.quest_desc: [
		"Oh, a classic, Loot Bags."
		""
		"They give a random assortment of items. It all depends on what tier of loot bag you get, whether it be common, rare, or even a Legendary. Try your luck and see."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Definitely try to get to automating for these. Just you wait."
	]
	quest.627F17A329AD2A10.quest_subtitle: "Give me all the things!"
	quest.627F17A329AD2A10.title: "Loot goblin"
	quest.643AEE8CC5A23943.quest_subtitle: "Mmm Food"
	quest.68F4293F2A430717.quest_desc: ["If you want to create a team for you and your friends, to betray (or not) use the command &a/ftbteams party create (name of team)&r to create the team!"]
	quest.68F4293F2A430717.quest_subtitle: "\"Two heads are better than one, and a teams of heads is even better.\""
	quest.68F4293F2A430717.title: "Teams"
	quest.6B66589B7C78CBFA.quest_desc: [
		"We have FTB Essentials, so we have some handy commands for you all!"
		" "
		"&e/sethome and /home&r will set a home command at your current position, and send you back there as needed."
		"&e/rtp&r will send you to a random location, be wary this does have a cooldown however."
	]
	quest.6B66589B7C78CBFA.quest_subtitle: "Wrong lever!"
	quest.6F0718A3F0C741A4.quest_desc: ["[ \"As denoted \", { \"text\": \"here\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4AA3BBE631909B07\" } }, \", there is changed recipes. You will find out later what these are, unless you look ahead. Just know this now. You will hate the late to end game.\" ]"]
